==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Shibalien]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Helmut Krabbe]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Zory]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*3 [[Helmut Krabbe]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*2 [[Zroco]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Nimoy Bore]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Kroxo]]s spawn, delay 10~30 seconds<sup>300f~900f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Shibalien]]s spawn, delay 10~30 seconds<sup>300f~900f</sup>.
**3 [[Shibalien]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Zroco]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Shibalien]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**1 [[Zang Roo]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Get all crystals from ItF to make this stage far easier. Then this stage essentially becomes [[Floating Continent (Into the Future)|Floating Continent]] but slightly more difficult.

